---
import NavigationBar from "../../components/NavigationBar.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import MainView from "../../layouts/MainView.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <div class="flex flex-inital justify-center">
        <MainView>
            <NavigationBar />
            <h1 class="text-4xl mt-8">About Me</h1>
            <p class="text-lg">Hi, I am Mubin Muhammad(screen name,{" "}
            <span class="italic">mubin-thinks</span>),</p>
            <p class="text-lg paragraph">
                I'm current a high-school student with interest in Software Engineering/
                Development, I have a good grasp on The C Programming Language and basics
                of C++. In the past, I had interest in Graphics Programming and learned
                the basics of OpenGL, with which I have created a small Game & Image
                Processor in C++.
            </p>
            <br>
            <p class="text-lg paragraph">
                Apart from working on small projects, I focus on Competitve Programming &
                Participating in Contests. Though I'm currently below-average in this
                category and thus taking it more seriously.
            </p>
            <br>
            <p class="text-lg paragraph">
                I also look into web-development technologies. Though, this side rapidly
                changes in a short time, I have a few that I like, namely SolidJS & Astro.
                Because they are one of the lightweight and fast UI Library & Framework
                respectively. I also appreciate React, Preact, Alpine.js, Svelte & more.
            </p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl mt-8">My Current Task</h1>
            <p class="text-lg inline">
                At the time of writing, my focus is primarily on Competitive Programming
                and the upcoming IOI(Internation Olympiad in Informatics) 2027.
            </p>
        </MainView>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .paragraph {
        display: inline;
        margin-left: 3rem;
    }
</style>